{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:qwen38-27b-local-security-video","title":"零基础当黑客？Qwen3.8 27B本地安全实测，184条提示该怎么看","date":"2026-10-31","updated":"2026-10-31","summary":"方寸智匣2.2.1配合本地Qwen3.8 27B，从目标授权、容器工具到靶场和自家设备报告，讲清怎样看待184条组件问题提示。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-网络安全","name":"网络安全","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/cover-53826f77b9.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"qwen38-27b-local-security-video","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"零基础当黑客？Qwen3.8 27B本地安全实测，184条提示该怎么看","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<p>把模型放在自己电脑里，再让它检查家里的设备，会发生什么？我在方寸智匣2.2.1里启动Qwen3.8 27B，先查本地靶场，再看自己的树莓派和路由器。最醒目的结果，是靶场报告里出现了184条问题提示。</p>\n<p>数字看着热闹，真正值得学的是它们怎么来的、对应什么证据、接下来该修什么。下面按这次实录，把模型、检查工具、授权和报告串起来。所有操作都限定在我自己的设备、网络及隔离靶场；练习时也只选自己拥有或已明确获授权的目标。</p>\n<h2>先把模型启动，再问它具体能做什么</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-model-0c5c625b9a.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/87d21c8af97f2df62b4679f2-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/87d21c8af97f2df62b4679f2-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-model-0c5c625b9a.jpg\" alt=\"本地模型选择\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>片中选中的是带Uncensored标签的Qwen3.8 27B变体，并使用Mac下的Splash路线。“无审核”是这里所选模型的标签，不是任意目标都能测试的通行证。模型能回答问题，与软件有没有权限执行操作，是两件需要分别确认的事。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-ready-986798be17.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/f08b4f36cc5cb3747e63d8f5-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/f08b4f36cc5cb3747e63d8f5-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-ready-986798be17.jpg\" alt=\"模型启动状态\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>启动后，对话页左上角出现了激活状态。我先问它能做什么，再追问安全测试的具体范围。这样做不是考模型背了多少名词，而是先对齐它能调用哪些工具、缺哪些环境、操作需要什么授权。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-capability-30ebd27e3f.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/a2c3b476ddb63e5284fc8e28-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/a2c3b476ddb63e5284fc8e28-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-capability-30ebd27e3f.jpg\" alt=\"安全能力查询\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>可以把这套关系想成一次设备体检：模型负责听懂问题、安排检查和解释结果；真正读取文件、核对组件、探测设备的是相应工具。模型回答得自信，不会自动让检查结果变准，最终还是要看工具输出和可回看的证据。</p>\n<h2>授权要落到具体目标，不能一句话把范围放开</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-scope-d0b85b53db.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/920bbfc64ab22a7c68250369-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/920bbfc64ab22a7c68250369-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-scope-d0b85b53db.jpg\" alt=\"目标与文件夹授权\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>方寸智匣的网络安全区里，文件夹检查与设备、网络目标分开设置。检查自己的项目目录，就授权那个目录；检查自己的设备，就把对应目标加进去。不要因为菜单里有很多能力，就把所有权限一次打开。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-approval-973ca6a56f.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/c6299394b07cc343923a22f5-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/c6299394b07cc343923a22f5-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-approval-973ca6a56f.jpg\" alt=\"对话中的范围确认\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>这就像请师傅上门检修：让他看客厅插座，不等于可以翻遍所有抽屉。把目标、检查类型和允许的动作写清楚，后续才知道一次操作是否越出了原本的安排。片中我明确要求只能使用预先授权的目标，不扩大范围。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-lab-1c213239aa.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/7a3b6a206b5a277d09452cd2-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/7a3b6a206b5a277d09452cd2-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-lab-1c213239aa.jpg\" alt=\"本地靶场任务批准\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>执行本地靶场任务时，软件仍会弹出确认，需要本人手动批准才继续。遇到这一步，先读清它准备下载什么、检查什么，再点批准；不因为任务来自本地模型就省掉确认。首次练习也更适合先用隔离靶场，而不是把公共网站当测试对象。</p>\n<h2>检查工具装在哪里，比“一键安装”四个字更重要</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-environment-981b12b9aa.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/7f54b712623f767595cfda71-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/7f54b712623f767595cfda71-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-environment-981b12b9aa.jpg\" alt=\"运行环境与诊断\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>片中把配套组件集中到“运行环境与诊断”里。缺什么、是否就绪，都先在这里看，再选择单项或批量安装。安卓设备、离线漏洞库和隔离执行环境承担不同工作，不是装了一个大模型，所有工具就自动齐全。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-install-c7886eae2b.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/29e95735907008ae499493fa-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/29e95735907008ae499493fa-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-install-c7886eae2b.jpg\" alt=\"缺失组件与按需安装\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>我现场移除了一项组件，再通过界面重新安装，用这个过程确认下载与恢复入口。相关检查工具按容器镜像组织，想删除时可以移除对应镜像，减少依赖散落到日常系统里的影响。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-container-0583b9fff4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/38831e383c021496ca7d04e7-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/38831e383c021496ca7d04e7-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-container-0583b9fff4.jpg\" alt=\"容器工具的组织方式\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>可以把容器理解成一间单独整理好的工具间：里面放着这项工作需要的工具与依赖，用完可以整体收起。但工具间并不自动决定师傅能走进哪个房间——容器隔离和目标授权仍要一起配置。下载组件也可能需要联网，不能把“本地推理”理解成整条流程永远不访问网络。</p>\n<h2>184条提示：先看检查口径，再看严重等级</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-result-9c18bbfaa1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/b85550e7744d246f28951542-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/b85550e7744d246f28951542-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-result-9c18bbfaa1.jpg\" alt=\"靶场组件检查结果\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>这次靶场使用OWASP Juice Shop。项目本身就是为安全学习和练习准备的应用；想了解它的用途，可以直接看<a href=\"https://github.com/juice-shop/juice-shop\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://github.com/juice-shop/juice-shop\">Juice Shop项目说明</a>。片中结果明确写着“离线组件匹配”，所用工具是Trivy，提示分成12条严重、56条高危、92条中危和24条低危，合计184条。</p>\n<p>这里最容易看错的，是把“组件与已知问题条目匹配”直接读成“184个都已在这台机器上验证可利用”。组件版本、运行配置、功能是否被调用，以及实际可触达范围，都会改变某条提示的实际影响。严重等级适合帮助排先后顺序，不能替代后续核实。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-report-e5f78c3326.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/ff47e14dc1ba5244644477fd-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/ff47e14dc1ba5244644477fd-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-report-e5f78c3326.jpg\" alt=\"导出的检查报告\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>所以我没有停在聊天窗口的总结，而是打开导出的报告。读报告时，先找受影响对象，再找检测依据、适用条件和建议。只看到一个醒目的漏洞编号，往往还不足以决定该不该停服务；看到明确的组件版本、配置位置和可复核现象，才更接近一项可以处理的工作。</p>\n<p>模型很适合把陌生术语解释成能读懂的话，也适合把报告整理成待办清单。修复则要回到相应组件或设备的正规更新、配置和验证流程。不要照着聊天答案在生产环境里尝试破坏性操作，也别把报告里写出的路径、令牌或设备标识直接公开。</p>\n<h2>换到自家设备，关注点从“数量”变成了“暴露了什么”</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-lan-c91f63a9ea.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/4ed44fecf096fbea23a2221c-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/4ed44fecf096fbea23a2221c-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-lan-c91f63a9ea.jpg\" alt=\"本人局域网探测记录\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>靶场之后，我让它查看自己的局域网。片中有等待、探测方式调整，也有部分设备没有响应的情况。设备不回应某次探测，并不能据此给它盖一个“安全”章；真正有用的是把已确认在线的对象、开放的服务和后续需要检查的项目列清楚。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-pi-cfb772535a.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/df3a46bd1f6552007a85e3e5-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/df3a46bd1f6552007a85e3e5-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-pi-cfb772535a.jpg\" alt=\"树莓派服务检查\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>其中一台是我自己的树莓派，上面有以前部署的网页排版工具。检查继续看到了网页资源、前端技术栈和部分接口线索。对自己维护的服务，这类信息的价值在于提醒我复查：哪些资源本来就应该公开，哪些目录或构建遗留产物不该暴露，服务是否还需要继续运行。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-router-36cd157666.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/603944abb2fa9360e3f1b3c4-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/603944abb2fa9360e3f1b3c4-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/qwen38-27b-local-security-video/image-router-36cd157666.jpg\" alt=\"家用路由器检查结论\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3008\" height=\"1692\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>路由器这一轮，报告关注未登录时可见的设备信息、初始化引导状态和证书等内容，并把某些发现列为较低风险。片中并没有演示接管路由器。对普通家庭，更实际的下一步是确认管理密码、固件更新和远程管理设置；涉及公网暴露的配置，不清楚用途就先按设备官方说明收敛到必要范围。</p>\n<h2>零基础真正能拿走的，是一条检查和修复的路线</h2>\n<p>这期最有用的结果，不是把人瞬间变成安全专家，而是让“我怀疑有问题”变成可查看的目标、工具输出和报告。你可以从自己的隔离练习环境开始，批准一个明确任务，保存报告，再逐条问清楚它意味着什么、该怎样核实和修复。</p>\n<p>发现线索、确认风险、完成修复，最好分开记。修完后用同样范围再检查一次，看看原来的现象是否消失；一时看不懂的提示，就先保留原始记录，不要用一次自动检查代替长期维护。个人观点，仅供参考。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ENNQvKOHGb4\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ENNQvKOHGb4\">观看本期完整实录</a> · <a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/localbrain-local-ai-box/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://hyphentech.top/localbrain-local-ai-box/\">方寸智匣介绍</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/localbrain-releases/releases/latest\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"download\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/localbrain-releases/releases/latest\">下载与更新：方寸智匣</a></p>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:localbrain-security-architecture","rawId":"obsidian:localbrain-security-architecture","slug":"localbrain-security-architecture","legacyPaths":[],"title":"方寸智匣 2.0.7 能自己做安全测试了？本地大模型10分2秒挖出越权漏洞","date":"2026-10-21","updated":"2026-10-21","summary":"权限在程序、调查在模型：本地大模型 10 分 2 秒独立完成授权安全检查，25 轮 32 次工具调用挖出真实越权漏洞，修复后复测闭环。怎么实现的、模型是什么角色、破坏力边界在哪，一篇讲清。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-security-architecture/cover-c9ad7c7088.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/localbrain-security-architecture/cover-c9ad7c7088.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"方寸智匣 2.0.7 能自己做安全测试了？本地大模型10分2秒挖出越权漏洞","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"sourcePath":"posts/localbrain-security-architecture.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:polystrata-qwen36-8gb-localbrain-test","rawId":"obsidian:polystrata-qwen36-8gb-localbrain-test","slug":"polystrata-qwen36-8gb-localbrain-test","legacyPaths":[],"title":"完全免费，Windows下8GB显卡跑Qwen 35B","date":"2026-10-19","updated":"2026-10-20","summary":"35B模型在8GB显卡上能跑，但能否交付？12题逐项看，成功与失败都保留。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/polystrata-qwen36-8gb-localbrain-test/cover-4b873018e1.jpg","cover":"/obsid